            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>The present invention relates to a cooling unit (30) for a transportable refrigerator box (10) having a storage space (24) for storing goods to be transported, the refrigerator box (10) comprising a front wall (12) and an opening (20) opposite the front wall (12), wherein the cooling unit is adapted for being positioned in the storage space (24) and comprises a separation structure (34) adapted for separating a first portion (36) of the storage space between the front wall (12) and the separation structure (34) from a second portion (38) of the storage space between the separation structure (34) and the opening (20); and the cooling unit (30) comprises a first cooling device (32) mounted on the separation structure (34), the first cooling device adapted to cool the first portion (36) of the storage space.</p>
            </abstract>
